Third-party acknowledgments
===========================

The MIT License above covers enZoRec's original Android source code and
documentation. The project starts from an idea by Salvatore Sanfilippo
(antirez) and his YouRec for iOS (https://github.com/antirez/YouRecApp),
which is also MIT-licensed (Copyright (c) 2026 Salvatore Sanfilippo);
Salvatore Sanfilippo reserves rights to the YouRec name and icon as branding,
hence this Android project ships under the enZoRec name.

The original YouRec for iOS bundles additional third-party assets (RNNoise,
DeepFilterNet3, LavaSR, VoiceFixer, Qwen3-ASR, fonts and others) that retain
their own licenses and notices; those components are not part of this
Android repository unless explicitly included. See the iOS project's
LICENSE and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for the full index.
